{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CYCLE</strong> is a game that follows Lana, a 22 year old woman who recently lost her mother to unknown causes. Her mother was on a journey to restore energy back to the Tower of the Stars, which provides the energy to the country they live in. After her mother did not return, Lana decides to try and find out the truth herself, and embark on the journey to the Tower of the Stars herself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, Dash, Scale walls to explore the world around you and overcome challenges, utilizing the dash to gain momentum and clear obstacles with ease!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items, upgrades and new weapons to expand the ways you can fight and interact with the world.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to characters around the world to learn more about it, and find shops to sell you new items to help you on your way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight strong enemies and exciting bosses with the abilities you've gathered to overcome them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secrets hiding within CYCLE's world.. some that may even lead you to new bosses and a whole new ending!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by the Mega Man Zero series, as well as titles in the Metroidvania genre of games.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reconsider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1947160/52d75797663dabd8c127470c7e9b3cd390ed7967.jpg"},{"name":"Chargeback","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1947160/ca3fbc3098b2e9709700b3ce17f3b4a0661c5834.jpg"},{"name":"Core Exercises","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1947160/695dd7da5794271c0e7595b3c165602f6b08c275.jpg"},{"name":"Scorpio Season","path":"https://cdn.aka